  "comparison": "F G_tot ratio=17.3, max RfG=84.85. At A=100, MAE_sw=2.7932e-01 vs global-k 2.6734e-01 vs per-neuron-k 5.0728e-02. At A=1e5, MAE_sw=4.8761e-04.",
