  "hardware_level": "LEVEL 2 behavioral TIA. A real op-amp would add the same G_tot into the loop equation.",
  "conclusion": "FINITE OPEN-LOOP GAIN IS NOT A GLOBAL SCALE ON THIS FABRIC.",
